Implement user story AMSD-1820: Fix promo code amount display for return trip tickets in Mozio email confirmation

## Story Description
The promo code discount amount is not displayed as expected for return trip tickets in the Mozio email confirmation. When a customer purchases a return trip ticket using a promo code, the discount amount shown in the email confirmation is incorrect or missing, while one-way trip tickets display the promo code amount correctly. This story fixes the promo code amount display for return trip tickets so that the discount amount and name appear correctly in the Mozio email confirmation.

